+> ## LOCAL OVERRIDE (2026-09-09) - read this before the font, colour and imagery sections
+>
+> This skill supplies **spacing rules, restraint and layout logic**. It does NOT
+> supply the typeface, the palette, or the images.
+>
+> - **Fonts:** `SF Pro Display` and `Helvetica Neue` are Apple/Linotype licensed and
+>   cannot legally be self-hosted as webfonts, which contradicts the self-hosting [P0] in
+>   BRAND-SYSTEM-GUIDE sec. 4.5. (The skill is right to ban Inter/Roboto/Open Sans.)
+> - **Palette:** the pale-pastel hex list is one hardcoded palette. Generate the ramp.
+> - **Imagery:** never ship `picsum.photos`. It is random stock, it is a placeholder that
+>   reaches production, and it is exactly the stock-photo tell. Use `/assets`.
